      "source_document": "14884716",
      "original_line": 69,
      "text": " 1.3. The Rent Control Tribunal by its impugned order dated 20.01.2023 held that Respondent No. 2, Canara Bank has sub-let the subject property to the sub-tenants including the Petitioner herein unlawfully as no consent in writing of the landlord was obtained.",
