    {
      "id": "IK-14884716:L71",
      "source_document": "14884716",
      "original_line": 71,
      "text": " 1.5. In this regard, it would be relevant to note that the remaining sub- tenants i.e., Respondent Nos. 3 to 6 herein had filed an independent petition CM(M) 336/2023 against the impugned order dated 20.01.2023, which was dismissed by a Coordinate Bench of this Court by a judgement dated 12.04.2023 and in pursuance thereof the said sub-tenants have vacated their portion of the subject property.",
      "provenance": [
        {
          "document_id": "14884716",
          "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/14884716/",
          "response_index": 0,
          "raw_path": "outputs/rgcn-data-expansion-09/continuation-01/open-14884716-0.txt",
