      "id": "IK-14884716:L76",
      "source_document": "14884716",
      "original_line": 76,
      "text": " 3. The learned counsel for the Petitioner has sought to distinguish his case from the remaining sub-tenants by relying upon additional documents, which have been filed in this petition with CM APPL. 11364/2023. He states that due to these documents the findings of the Coordinate Bench in judgement dated 12.04.2023 are not applicable.",
      "provenance": [
        {
          "document_id": "14884716",
          "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/14884716/",
