      "source_document": "14884716",
      "original_line": 79,
      "text": " 3.3. He states that the Petitioner herein is not required to give any statutory notice to the landlord with respect to the creation of the sub-tenancy in its favour within the meaning of cite16†Section 17 of the DRC Act.",
