      "source_document": "14884716",
      "original_line": 82,
      "text": "He states that the stand, which is now sought to be urged in this petition that the landlord had knowledge of sub-tenancy and is therefore, entitled to protection under cite15†Section 18 of DRC Act was never raised in the Courts below and therefore deserved to be rejected on this ground alone. 4.2.",
      "provenance": [
        {
