      "original_line": 89,
      "text": ">  xxx xxx xxx \"18(a)(i) Contents of para No. 18 (a) (i) of the petition are wrong, are not admitted and are denied. It is denied that the respondent No. 1 has sub-let, assigned or parted with possession of the premises in suit in favour of Signature Not Verified Digitally Signed CM(M) 380/2023 Page 4 of 13 By:Rashmi Dabas Signing Date:20.10.2023 10:34:02 respondents No.2 to 6 or anyone else. The present petition is without any cause of action and is an abuse of the process of law.",
