      "source_document": "14884716",
      "original_line": 93,
      "text": ">  Without admitting the allegations made in the petition, it is submitted that as per clause 4(a) of the lease deed dated 27.3.1944 the respondent has got the right to sub-let the whole or part of the premises in suit. Clause 4(a) of the lease deed dated 27.3.1944 reads as under :-",
      "provenance": [
