      "source_segment_id": "IK-14884716:L103",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 341
    },
    {
      "id": "IK-14884716:L104",
      "source_document": "14884716",
      "original_line": 104,
      "text": " (Emphasis Supplied) 4.3. He states that as is evident from the written statement, the original tenant ('Canara Bank') and the other Respondents had denied sub-letting to avoid eviction under cite13†Section 14 (1) (b) of the DRC Act. He states therefore, the plea of protected sub-tenancy under cite15†Section 18 of the DRC Act now sought to be raised by this Petitioner is a complete somersault. 4.4.",
      "provenance": [
        {
          "document_id": "14884716",
          "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/14884716/",
          "response_index": 0,
          "raw_path": "outputs/rgcn-data-expansion-09/continuation-01/open-14884716-0.txt",
          "raw_sha256": "ba7944f4cf5c9b54f09efe24e80b7b2f1d45606c9076b55ba3e0bd3b2e8b5a05",
          "raw_char_range": [
