      "source_document": "14884716",
      "original_line": 107,
      "text": " 4.6. He relies upon the judgement of the Supreme Court in M/s. cite17†Girdhari Signature Not Verified Digitally Signed CM(M) 380/2023 Page 6 of 13 By:Rashmi Dabas Signing Date:20.10.2023 10:34:02 Lal and Sons vs. Balbir Nath Mathur & Ors. 1986 (2) SCC 237 and the judgement of the Single Judge of this Court in Tara Chand vs. Mst.",
